{"abstract":[{"text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Create a new iOS project","type":"heading","anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File > New > Project…"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency","type":"heading","anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and on the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" repository only exists for distributing the iOS package of MapLibre Native. To report issues and ask questions, use the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Verify you can import MapLibre in your app:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import MapLibre"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"SwiftUI","text":"SwiftUI"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To use MapLibre with SwiftUI we need to create a wrapper for the UIKit view that MapLibre provides (using UIViewRepresentable. The simplest way to implement this protocol is as follows:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct SimpleMap: UIViewRepresentable {","    func makeUIView(context _: Context) -> MLNMapView {","        let mapView = MLNMapView()","        return mapView","    }","","    func updateUIView(_: MLNMapView, context _: Context) {}","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use this view directly in a SwiftUI View hierarchy, for example:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            SimpleMap().edgesIgnoringSafeArea(.all)","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When running your app in the simulator you should be greeted with the default ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","type":"reference"},{"text":" style:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"UIKit","type":"heading","anchor":"UIKit"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use the following ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to get started with MapLibre Native iOS with UIKit.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class SimpleMap: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        view.addSubview(mapView)","","        mapView.delegate = self","    }","","    \/\/ MLNMapViewDelegate method called when map has finished loading","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading _: MLNStyle) {","    }","}"]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"title":"Getting Started","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AddMarkerSymbolExample":{"title":"Add Marker","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/addmarkersymbolexample","abstract":[{"text":"Simply add a marker to a map!","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"https://cocoapods.org":{"url":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","type":"link","title